WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:01.960
I love you too.

00:00:04.046 --> 00:00:04.880
Did you mean it?

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.548
Of course, I meant it.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:11.595
No.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.763
No, you know what?

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:14.723
If I'm gonna feel guilty
about something,

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:16.433
I'm gonna feel guilty
about this.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.586
$49.99?
Can we sell it that low?

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:53.303
We're all gonna die!

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:54.513
Please, save us
from destruction.

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:55.848
Thank you, Ganesh.

00:00:55.931 --> 00:00:57.766
We're all gonna die!

00:01:00.102 --> 00:01:01.270
Dear Allah,

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:02.938
in your infinite power
and compassion,

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:04.606
please save us
from destruction.

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:16.618
Try and slow your breathing.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:19.413
I can't.

00:01:21.957 --> 00:01:22.875
Stiles, look at me.

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.127
Look at me.

00:01:25.711 --> 00:01:26.628
Stiles.

00:02:08.045 --> 00:02:09.004
You love me.

00:02:09.505 --> 00:02:11.381
You're such an idiot.

00:02:14.843 --> 00:02:16.303
I love you too.

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:38.742
-Hey.
-Hey.

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:39.952
Thought I might
find you in here.

00:02:40.035 --> 00:02:42.287
I just needed to process
the captain's news.

00:02:42.371 --> 00:02:43.580
I feel so bad for him.

00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:45.457
So, how you holdin' up?

00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:48.335
I don't know.
I'm still in shock.

00:02:48.919 --> 00:02:49.795
You?

00:02:50.295 --> 00:02:51.588
I'm basically handling it

00:02:51.672 --> 00:02:53.090
the way I dealt
with my dad leaving,

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:55.175
just repressing
the hell out of it.

00:02:58.762 --> 00:03:00.514
So, a lot of change
around here, huh?

00:03:12.651 --> 00:03:14.611
Hey, Jake,
the new captain's here.

00:03:58.363 --> 00:03:59.198
There you are.

00:04:00.866 --> 00:04:02.659
Are you hiding up here
from my friends?

00:04:03.493 --> 00:04:04.661
No.

00:04:04.745 --> 00:04:05.746
I like your friends.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:07.289
Come on, Fab.

00:04:07.372 --> 00:04:08.624
I haven't seen you
this nervous

00:04:08.707 --> 00:04:10.250
since the last
Space X launch.

00:04:10.959 --> 00:04:12.628
It's really upsetting
when they explode.

00:04:13.629 --> 00:04:15.631
Well, why don't we just
hang out in here,

00:04:16.298 --> 00:04:17.299
you and me?

00:04:23.347 --> 00:04:24.181
Wait,

00:04:24.932 --> 00:04:26.141
I am hooking up in here?

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.772
About ten minutes ago.

00:04:33.732 --> 00:04:35.359
No, I didn't know
what to say.

00:04:36.860 --> 00:04:37.986
Yes, I know.

00:04:39.738 --> 00:04:42.908
Um, I don't know, Mom.
He's my best friend.

00:04:45.953 --> 00:04:47.037
Yeah, he's great.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.458
Yeah, I think I am.

00:04:53.961 --> 00:04:55.838
I have to go. I will.

00:04:58.590 --> 00:04:59.716
Listen, Jim…

00:05:23.365 --> 00:05:24.324
Did you mean it?

00:05:27.369 --> 00:05:28.537
Of course, I meant it.

00:05:45.429 --> 00:05:47.097
I can't. I can't do this.

00:05:47.181 --> 00:05:48.307
OK.

00:05:48.932 --> 00:05:49.808
I understand.

00:05:59.318 --> 00:06:00.235
I don't…

00:06:00.319 --> 00:06:01.737
I don't want
to lose you again.

00:06:02.321 --> 00:06:04.615
I know. I'm confused.

00:06:04.698 --> 00:06:05.824
This is confusing me.

00:06:23.258 --> 00:06:24.384
Ruby, don't look.

